        "eyebrow": "Savoir-faire",
        "heading": "Cut by hand, finished slowly",
        "text": "<p>Every garment is drafted, cut and sewn in one atelier. We work in small series so the patterns can be perfected and the finish stays honest. Nothing is rushed onto a rail to fill a season.</p>",
